  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to UNAIDS 2016-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim of the project is for UNAIDS to lead, coordinate and strengthen the global response to HIV/AIDS in order to end the AIDS epidemic by 2030. UNAIDS makes an important contribution towards reaching DFID&#x2019;s Strategic Objective to eliminate extreme poverty through co-ordinating the global response to the HIV/AIDS epidemic. As the leading advocate for global action against HIV/AIDS at both the global and country level, UNAIDS plays a key role in delivering against objectives set out in HMG&#x2019;s Aid Strategy to tackle epidemic diseases and drug resistant infections. UNAIDS also remains an integral part of the international architecture for delivering against Global Goal 3 to end the AIDS epidemic by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
